  "body_html": "<h1>Solvable Game</h1>\n<p>A game is solvable if the set $S^\\infty$ of rationalizable outcomes is reduced to\na singleton:\n$$\n  S^\\infty=\\{s^*\\}.\n$$\nThis captures games whose common-rationality elimination process predicts a\nunique profile.</p>",
